WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.502
The directory pairs friendly domains with their original localhost ports.

00:00:03.502 --> 00:00:06.973
Search by domain or port. Here, filter the list to the API.

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:10.140
Edit app.test and type a memorable name: storefront.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:14.705
Review the old and new domains before confirming the change.

00:00:14.705 --> 00:00:19.247
Saved. Caddy now routes storefront.test to the same app; the project file stays unchanged.

00:00:19.247 --> 00:00:23.751
Undo restores app.test and its route. No project configuration edit is needed.
